OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after being injured
OL,4,Aby armed police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 40s has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter being injured in a shooting
OL,8,Finvolving armed police.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police responded to
OL,11,Freports of a suspected firearm at an
OL,12,Faddress on Fishponds Road in Bristol on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FPolice said firearms were discharged
OL,16,Fbefore their negotiators arrived,
OL,17,Fleaving a man with non-life-threatening
OL,18,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
