OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after being injured
OL,4,Aby armed police
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man remains in hospital under
OL,7,Fpolice guard and has now been arrested
OL,8,Fon suspicion of affray and of
OL,9,Fpossessing an imitation firearm with
OL,10,Fintent to cause fear of violence.
